Objective Brief
We are building K01 (Evidence Intelligence) — the initial Layer C proprietary analytical kernel for CosmicCouncil. Rather than jumping straight to weighted astrological scores (PHI, YSI, DSI, House Intelligence, Domain Matrices), K01 establishes a pure-TypeScript, deterministic, Cloudflare-Workers-safe foundation that consumes the read-only LayerCAnalyticalInput contract (v2.layer_c_input.1.0) from server/services/v2Engine/ and outputs a versioned, reproducible AnalyticalEvidenceRepository.
Every downstream capability (K02–K10 and domain engines) will build on four pillars created across these phases:
	1. Canonical Evidence Objects across 12 standardized evidence families (with secondary tags, multi-axis verification/empirical statuses, frame/methodology isolation, and temporal scope separation).
	2. Traceable Evidence Lineage & Separate Impact Contracts (DAG-enforced parent-child derivation, overlap/duplication classification, and an un-weighted contextual impact contract).
	3. Extensible Planetary State Contracts populated strictly from directly supported observations/measurements (leaving un-ruled analytical dimensions explicitly unevaluated).
	4. Diagnostic Execution & Verification reusing cached Chris 4 foundational data, scripts/verifyV2Engine.ts, and the existing Admin V2 Diagnostic Lab without mutating V1/V2 foundational calculation code or customer flows.

